WEBVTT

00:02.440 --> 00:06.080
Science revealed humankind's true nature.

00:06.480 --> 00:09.020
Perhaps God created a spherical world

00:09.020 --> 00:12.240
to keep them from seeing
 too far into the distance

00:12.240 --> 00:15.760
because he feared for their future.

00:16.900 --> 00:20.300
This is a mito, a tree 
that produces witches.

00:21.120 --> 00:23.370
I won't resurrect Chloe.

00:23.370 --> 00:25.880
I'm the one who made that decision.

00:26.340 --> 00:29.250
Who are you showing off for?

00:29.250 --> 00:31.640
You're merely human.

00:32.440 --> 00:36.260
I'll hunt down the humans myself.

00:36.260 --> 00:37.870
You stay out of this.

00:41.520 --> 00:44.110
Anti-Witch Iaigiri:

00:44.110 --> 00:46.860
Scattering Blossoms!

00:53.770 --> 00:58.600
Armor-Style Derivative: 
Zephyr Armor Formula!

01:03.870 --> 01:05.920
Execute repairs.

01:08.750 --> 01:12.270
Science, huh? Such crude tricks.

01:12.270 --> 01:13.510
Just like your magic!

01:15.000 --> 01:17.520
The mito is burned to a crisp.

01:18.090 --> 01:23.100
No witches will be born ever again.

01:23.760 --> 01:26.020
Maximum electrothermal output!

01:46.640 --> 01:48.210
Quit screwing around.

01:48.760 --> 01:49.960
Caliburn.

01:57.210 --> 01:59.040
Revenge, huh?

01:59.420 --> 02:03.470
You and I have the same look in our eyes.

02:12.230 --> 02:15.020
Enough!

02:21.740 --> 02:24.800
<i>I... can't move...</i>

02:27.010 --> 02:29.670
You've got some powerful spells.

02:31.250 --> 02:34.000
<b>Love Spell</b>

02:31.500 --> 02:34.000
<b>Mandragora</b>

04:17.520 --> 04:19.480
My name is Doroka.

04:19.880 --> 04:22.060
You're their leader, aren't you?

04:22.060 --> 04:23.990
What's your name?

04:28.280 --> 04:30.750
It's Yamato.

04:32.220 --> 04:33.900
<i>Why did I answer her?</i>

04:33.900 --> 04:36.770
<i>No, my mouth opened on its own.</i>

04:36.770 --> 04:39.040
<i>This spell is dangerous.</i>

04:39.690 --> 04:40.880
It's Doroka.

04:40.880 --> 04:42.010
Doroka.

04:42.010 --> 04:44.400
What can she do now?

04:44.400 --> 04:46.730
But maybe, with her magic...

04:51.740 --> 04:54.010
Dispel this magic immediately!

04:54.390 --> 04:57.370
Love Spell: Mandragora.

04:58.270 --> 05:01.030
<b>Love Spell</b>

04:58.520 --> 05:01.030
<b>Mandragora</b>

05:04.730 --> 05:07.400
You shut down his mobility. Nice work.

05:07.400 --> 05:10.910
Now kill him! Tear out his throat!

05:15.160 --> 05:17.160
Please, Mr. Yamato.

05:17.940 --> 05:21.530
No more fighting. Let this be the end.

05:21.530 --> 05:23.680
Let's shake hands and make up.

05:24.720 --> 05:25.930
What?

05:25.930 --> 05:30.430
Mr. Yamato, say you won't fight anymore.

05:31.190 --> 05:37.440
Promise me you won't attack us or Adonis.

05:37.440 --> 05:41.320
Promise me this, and I'll dispel my magic.

05:41.320 --> 05:44.190
I'll release all your soldiers, too.

05:45.100 --> 05:47.120
What are you talking about?

05:47.990 --> 05:50.150
They killed Anna.

05:51.700 --> 05:52.700
Listen up!

05:53.200 --> 05:57.340
You must be out of your mind 
to let the humans leave alive

05:57.340 --> 05:59.960
after how many of you they killed!

05:59.960 --> 06:01.710
He's right.

06:01.710 --> 06:05.460
If you don't kill him 
this instant, you'll die!

06:07.460 --> 06:09.210
Indeed!

06:10.720 --> 06:12.720
Love Spell? Bah!

06:12.720 --> 06:15.090
It's absurd!

06:15.090 --> 06:16.360
Know your place, witch!

06:16.850 --> 06:19.850
We'll use our science to exterminate you!

06:19.850 --> 06:22.400
A ceasefire? Don't be ridiculous!

06:22.400 --> 06:27.320
Witches are a scourge 
that bring terror and chaos!

06:27.320 --> 06:31.040
Their mere existence harms the world!

06:31.040 --> 06:34.540
Do you know what your 
apprentice did to our nation?

06:34.540 --> 06:35.560
He caused a catastrophe!

06:35.560 --> 06:39.040
He killed countless innocent people!

06:39.040 --> 06:44.040
That fiend wouldn't exist 
if not for you witches!

06:40.130 --> 06:42.840
We can move, too.

06:42.840 --> 06:44.040
Yeah.

06:44.040 --> 06:47.800
Accept your extermination, scum!

06:48.040 --> 06:49.440
<i>That's right.</i>

06:49.440 --> 06:53.420
<i>Without magic, that wouldn't 
have happened to Yuki.</i>

06:53.800 --> 06:55.560
You damn...

06:55.820 --> 06:58.310
witches!

06:58.720 --> 07:02.560
You've killed countless people, too.

07:04.070 --> 07:10.570
So much blood has been shed both during 
the witch hunts ten years ago and today.

07:10.570 --> 07:12.140
Why?

07:12.140 --> 07:16.490
Even if you don't need us 
now that you have science,

07:16.490 --> 07:18.830
there's no need to kill us.

07:19.340 --> 07:22.330
Witches and humans used to be friends.

07:22.870 --> 07:27.840
Mr. Yamato, why don't we end this conflict?

07:28.160 --> 07:33.840
First, I'd like you 
to order your men to retreat.

07:35.430 --> 07:37.360
You can't be serious.

07:38.050 --> 07:41.600
You'll listen to me, won't you?

07:46.410 --> 07:49.330
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

07:55.360 --> 07:56.910
<i>You can't be serious.</i>

08:02.020 --> 08:05.130
<i>I am a soldier of the great Redia Empire.</i>

08:07.660 --> 08:12.630
<i>Senior Director Yamato 
of the National Security Bureau.</i>

08:12.630 --> 08:18.660
<i>I won't be beaten by some magic spell!</i>

08:53.160 --> 08:53.920
I...

08:55.380 --> 08:57.520
I shall obey you.

08:59.480 --> 09:04.120
Because I lo—

09:21.900 --> 09:23.870
Only revenge.

09:26.880 --> 09:29.370
All I have is revenge.

09:29.920 --> 09:31.630
Director Yamato!

09:31.630 --> 09:34.040
A love spell?

09:34.040 --> 09:36.890
I see. That's truly powerful.

09:37.280 --> 09:39.070
Adonis...

09:39.380 --> 09:41.650
How could you?

09:42.390 --> 09:46.140
We'll use that magic to 
destroy humanity, Doroka.

09:46.870 --> 09:49.440
There's no need to pretend anymore.

09:50.400 --> 09:53.150
Capital City, New Nightmare

09:53.440 --> 09:56.150
The Royal Palace, The Ivory Tower

09:56.150 --> 09:57.910
And?

09:57.910 --> 10:00.060
I'm not interested in hearing nonsense.

10:00.060 --> 10:02.410
The witches will die, won't they?

10:02.410 --> 10:07.600
The strike force led by 
Director Yamato is still fighting.

10:07.600 --> 10:10.680
The last of the witches 
are putting up quite the fight.

10:10.680 --> 10:14.200
Communication with our 
forces on the ground is poor,

10:14.200 --> 10:16.520
so we don't know the exact details.

10:17.660 --> 10:20.560
The witches will die, won't they?

10:20.560 --> 10:23.790
I believe our victory is certain.

10:24.280 --> 10:26.560
The boy responsible for that calamity,

10:26.560 --> 10:29.040
Adonis, the witch's apprentice...

10:29.040 --> 10:30.560
Is he there as well?

10:31.290 --> 10:32.490
M-Most likely.

10:32.490 --> 10:34.070
Good.

10:34.070 --> 10:35.570
Very good.

10:35.570 --> 10:39.560
Burn the witches and the whole damn moon.

10:39.560 --> 10:44.320
The witches and that brat who sought 
revenge against humanity will die.

10:44.320 --> 10:47.330
Kill them all!

10:50.050 --> 10:52.130
How delightful!

10:52.130 --> 10:55.590
Today is such a good day, don't you think?

10:55.590 --> 11:02.220
Anyway, damn witches. How dare you 
escape to the moon, you sore losers!

11:02.450 --> 11:04.470
Oh, dear wife.

11:04.960 --> 11:07.670
Aren't I incredible?

11:09.230 --> 11:12.290
You're so beautiful...

11:13.720 --> 11:20.200
Hold me. Praise me.

11:24.740 --> 11:27.890
I finally did it!

11:27.890 --> 11:31.460
I finally killed all those damn witches!

11:33.860 --> 11:36.510
Thank you, thank you!

11:36.770 --> 11:42.180
I love you! I love you! 
I love you, my queen!

11:37.740 --> 11:40.800
<i>I'd heard his condition 
was deteriorating, but...</i>

11:40.800 --> 11:43.010
<i>He's lost his mind.</i>

11:43.010 --> 11:44.750
It's all right.

11:46.260 --> 11:48.690
What is this feeling inside me?

11:46.520 --> 11:50.320
Sometimes, he turns into a big baby.

11:48.690 --> 11:52.280
I love you! I love you so, so much!

11:52.280 --> 11:54.680
Please praise me. Praise me.

11:54.680 --> 11:57.680
I did my best.

11:55.220 --> 11:56.890
There, there.

11:57.680 --> 12:03.030
It's no wonder you've become unstable 
after enduring that for so long.

12:04.820 --> 12:06.580
Love Spell.

12:04.820 --> 12:07.780
<b>Love Spell</b>

12:07.780 --> 12:09.910
You did such a good job 
hunting those witches.

12:09.910 --> 12:11.800
Yeah. Uh-huh.

12:11.800 --> 12:15.550
So you can die now.

12:19.980 --> 12:21.800
Okay.

12:21.800 --> 12:25.800
Right, left, right, left.

12:25.800 --> 12:29.560
Oh, you're so good at walkies.

12:29.560 --> 12:33.310
Gonna die, gonna die.

12:37.700 --> 12:39.820
Your Majesty, what's gotten into you?

12:44.240 --> 12:49.050
I've always given you
everything you asked for.

12:49.050 --> 12:53.580
I'd give my own life to make you happy.

12:54.090 --> 12:57.830
Today is a truly wonderful day.

12:55.520 --> 12:57.830
You can do it, darling.

12:57.830 --> 13:02.680
I could die easily by jumping from here.

13:02.680 --> 13:06.600
I'm so smart. I'm the best emperor.

13:06.600 --> 13:09.480
I'm okay. I'm okay.

13:09.480 --> 13:11.360
I just have to jump.

13:11.360 --> 13:13.450
Your Majesty, get a hold of yourself!

13:13.450 --> 13:15.100
Please get down from there!

13:15.100 --> 13:16.850
Don't stop me.

13:17.130 --> 13:20.280
I am Emperor Goethe.

13:20.280 --> 13:23.560
I'm amazing. I'm an important guy, you know.

13:23.560 --> 13:26.980
I made lots of scientific advancements

13:26.980 --> 13:30.990
so the Redia Empire would be 
the strongest nation in the world.

13:30.990 --> 13:34.280
I killed all the witches.

13:34.280 --> 13:37.680
I did it all for my beloved queen.

13:38.250 --> 13:47.630
I did <i>everything</i> you asked 
 because I <i>love</i> you.

13:47.900 --> 13:54.890
My queen, I wish I could serve you forever.

13:54.890 --> 13:58.640
Oh, Goethe. You're making me blush.

13:59.140 --> 14:01.640
Now hurry up and die, okay?

14:05.650 --> 14:07.140
Your Majesty!

14:13.400 --> 14:18.920
Love Spell: Mandragora dispelled.

14:25.670 --> 14:28.920
I love you...

14:32.250 --> 14:35.430
S-Send backup. There's a witch in the castle.

14:35.730 --> 14:41.190
Sir, he slipped and fell, didn't he?

14:43.880 --> 14:46.560
Yes, that's right.

14:47.090 --> 14:48.900
Correction.

14:48.900 --> 14:51.200
Emperor Goethe has fallen to his death.

14:51.530 --> 14:53.590
Call someone to pick up the body right away.

14:55.530 --> 14:58.700
I love you, Your Majesty.

14:59.460 --> 15:00.890
Usagi.

15:03.990 --> 15:05.120
I'm here.

15:05.810 --> 15:07.460
You look like you want to say something.

15:07.780 --> 15:09.720
Should I not have killed him?

15:09.720 --> 15:11.300
That's no problem at all.

15:11.300 --> 15:14.340
That puppet was no longer necessary.

15:14.340 --> 15:18.730
My magic only controls men. 
It doesn't work on women.

15:18.730 --> 15:20.600
My kind are a threat.

15:20.600 --> 15:23.400
Thus, they needed to be culled.

15:25.120 --> 15:28.110
Now the world will be yours.

15:28.110 --> 15:29.460
Don't be stupid.

15:29.460 --> 15:32.610
I don't want this world.

15:34.320 --> 15:38.840
You know what I really want, don't you?

15:39.900 --> 15:45.490
You know what will happen if the next head 
you bring me is a dummy again, don't you?

15:46.210 --> 15:48.120
Don't worry.

15:48.120 --> 15:53.130
The man himself is 
as good as yours, my queen.

15:54.490 --> 15:56.630
I'm not a queen anymore.

15:56.630 --> 15:59.400
From now on, call me by my maiden name.

15:59.400 --> 16:01.890
Very well, Ms. Dorothea.

16:08.320 --> 16:13.240
I am Dorothea, the witch 
who races across the ensembleverse.

16:14.260 --> 16:18.400
I abandoned notions 
of hypocrisy a long time ago...

16:18.410 --> 16:21.660
<b>Witch of the Unknown</b>

16:18.410 --> 16:21.660
<b>Dorothea Grethe</b>

16:23.140 --> 16:25.750
...in order to get them back.

16:30.810 --> 16:34.760
We'll use that magic to 
destroy humankind, Doroka.

16:35.330 --> 16:36.760
Assist me.

16:37.390 --> 16:38.510
No.

16:40.100 --> 16:41.260
Oh, yeah?

16:44.560 --> 16:47.270
Don't drop your spell.

16:47.480 --> 16:48.510
Director Yamato!

16:48.510 --> 16:49.520
No!

16:49.520 --> 16:51.400
How could he?

16:51.400 --> 16:53.520
What an underhanded bastard!

16:53.520 --> 16:56.540
Damn. If only we could move...

16:56.540 --> 16:58.560
Hey, scum!

17:03.950 --> 17:05.500
Now, weep...

17:05.500 --> 17:08.550
like I did as a boy that day!

17:08.550 --> 17:11.290
No! Don't do this, Adonis!

17:16.050 --> 17:17.720
He's coming!

17:17.720 --> 17:18.800
Repel him!

17:18.800 --> 17:21.560
I can't move! Damn it!

17:29.530 --> 17:31.480
I didn't want to use this.

17:32.560 --> 17:37.440
I didn't want to use this spell on you.

17:38.070 --> 17:41.330
But if you won't stop, then...

17:43.790 --> 17:45.030
Do it.

17:46.280 --> 17:48.080
If you want to die again, that is.

17:52.330 --> 17:55.340
Please... please stop!

17:55.340 --> 17:58.220
Not happening, dumbass!

17:59.850 --> 18:01.400
Wait, Adonis!

18:01.400 --> 18:04.100
Killing more of them now 
won't change anything!

18:04.100 --> 18:07.600
Your revenge will only inspire new revenge!

18:07.600 --> 18:11.850
Don't lecture me with tired old expressions!

18:11.850 --> 18:13.360
It's not like that!

18:13.360 --> 18:15.080
I'm tired of this.

18:15.080 --> 18:18.370
Tired of the fighting never ending.

18:18.370 --> 18:21.860
Tired of watching so many 
lives be extinguished.

18:21.860 --> 18:23.850
It's just too sad...

18:23.850 --> 18:26.000
a world like this...

18:26.870 --> 18:28.320
Adonis!

18:51.640 --> 18:53.400
Written-Style Summoning Magic:

18:53.730 --> 18:56.650
<b>Paravoice</b>

18:54.490 --> 18:55.910
Paravoice.

18:58.880 --> 19:01.540
They'll pay for it with their extinction.

19:02.410 --> 19:05.160
Capital of the Redia Empire, New Nightmare
 National Science Agency Headquarters

19:05.160 --> 19:07.850
What happened to 
the guys who led the charge?

19:07.850 --> 19:09.920
Why isn't there any video?

19:10.450 --> 19:13.160
Show us the video, National Science Agency!

19:13.160 --> 19:16.500
All cameras are currently down.

19:16.500 --> 19:18.250
Were they wiped out?

19:18.670 --> 19:19.930
Impossible!

19:19.930 --> 19:21.940
They're the National Security Bureau's best.

19:21.940 --> 19:23.840
Director Yamato is with them.

19:23.840 --> 19:25.060
That can't be.

19:25.700 --> 19:27.430
All power down.

19:27.970 --> 19:29.580
Get it back up right away!

19:29.580 --> 19:30.930
What are you waiting for?

19:30.930 --> 19:33.520
Y-Yes, sir. One moment, please.

19:34.190 --> 19:36.700
I'm receiving a signal!

19:36.700 --> 19:38.160
Permission granted 
to access transmission line.

19:38.160 --> 19:39.650
Displaying video on monitor.

19:42.160 --> 19:44.680
<i>It's me, Yamato.</i>

19:45.070 --> 19:46.970
It's Director Yamato.

19:46.970 --> 19:48.080
He's all right.

19:49.020 --> 19:51.080
<i>I have a message for my 
colleagues on the surface.</i>

19:51.510 --> 19:53.340
<i>We've won.</i>

19:54.580 --> 19:56.920
<i>Notify His Majesty right away.</i>

19:56.920 --> 19:59.340
<i>All the witches on the 
moon's surface are dead.</i>

20:00.440 --> 20:03.760
However, the battle was fierce.

20:03.760 --> 20:06.840
I lost a lot of promising soldiers.

20:07.480 --> 20:09.680
None of the witches survived.

20:09.680 --> 20:11.600
But aside from me, we suffered the same.

20:12.030 --> 20:14.980
<i>All soldiers besides myself 
died in the line of duty.</i>

20:14.980 --> 20:16.360
<i>It's a shame.</i>

20:16.840 --> 20:19.650
Only I will be returning to the planet.

20:19.650 --> 20:22.360
I won't require any support.

20:22.360 --> 20:24.440
Isn't that...

20:24.440 --> 20:26.370
H-His skin...

20:27.520 --> 20:29.620
That thing isn't Yamato.

20:29.620 --> 20:32.460
Now, bring me back.

20:32.460 --> 20:34.870
I miss being on the planet's surface.

20:35.380 --> 20:38.640
I'll bring you back the head 
of the witch's apprentice.

20:42.680 --> 20:48.630
So this is what you wanted 
from the start, Adonis.

20:49.570 --> 20:55.150
You can disguise yourself as one of the 
soldiers called here and escape this place.

20:55.410 --> 20:59.150
You'd sacrifice us for that.

20:59.150 --> 21:01.400
No! Let go!

21:01.400 --> 21:02.930
Let go of me!

21:02.930 --> 21:04.950
That spell of yours is useful.

21:05.660 --> 21:06.820
Come.

21:08.310 --> 21:09.680
How could you?

21:10.160 --> 21:14.050
What would Chloe think 
if she could see you now?

21:20.400 --> 21:22.490
<i>Transfer initiated.</i>

21:27.400 --> 21:30.360
Farewell, Adonis.

21:32.420 --> 21:37.440
Infinitely evil child of the wicked humans.

21:38.660 --> 21:44.110
May God judge you for your crimes.

21:47.520 --> 21:53.060
I'm sorry for getting 
your hopes up, everyone.

21:54.950 --> 21:59.540
I failed to reclaim 
the dignity of the witches.

22:00.650 --> 22:03.760
I bid farewell to this world...

22:06.430 --> 22:08.990
to these kingdoms of ruin.

22:17.920 --> 22:19.730
I'm sorry.

22:27.730 --> 22:31.210
Transfer location coordinates set.

22:31.210 --> 22:32.880
Transfer in ten seconds.

22:33.490 --> 22:35.740
Director Yamato is returning.

22:37.790 --> 22:42.120
More accurately, it's the witch's 
apprentice disguised as Yamato.

22:43.000 --> 22:45.920
I'll avenge you, Yamato.

22:46.500 --> 22:51.520
Transfer complete in three, two, one...

22:52.030 --> 22:53.010
Fire.
